h Anna that we need verification, but still recommend A as provisional lead, because other candidates have stronger deficits in crew cooperation and communication, which are also safety-critical. Mention A's strengths: anticipation, complex connections, spatial vision, leadership. Mention that missing stress resilience is a gap but not enough to overturn.\n\nMetadata vote: Candidate A.\n\nLet's produce."}
